  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 9.48,
   "text": "Second good check, checked the same way, that's .2 spent. The limit, reached, one more call"
  },
  {
   "start": 10.16,
   "end": 17.52,
   "text": "and the contract says no before any money moves. Over budget, refused, on the record,"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.36,
   "end": 29.98,
   "text": "balance untouched. One honest limit. This protects the buyer, not the seller. A dishonest"
  },
  {
   "start": 29.98,
   "end": 34.42,
   "text": "checks every receipt. The contract only pays on one the buyer has signed."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.38,
   "end": 40.06,
   "text": "Meted pay, failed call, deducted, zero."
  }
